{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1324338442"}, "name":{"label":"Ajg3ng_8857"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-21T17:26:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.36"}, "id":{"label":"14091128893"}, "title":{"label":"Very effective but need to fix bug."}, "content":{"label":"I started exercising in December 2024 and I used this app for about 5 months and I lost 30 pounds. I didn’t workout in the summer because I thought I just wanted to hang out with friends. However, I came back in fall of 2025 and got more toned and I continue to use this app every now in then to stay in shape. Moral of the story is that this app is very effective but I would also recommend using a calorie counting app if you really wanna get serious. There was one issue that has just started recently, the calories I’ve burned arnt accurate. I know this because I did an advanced workout that would usually be 300 cals but it was only 100. I did EVERYTHING to fix this because I find it very annoying. I still love this app but I really wish they would fix this issue.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1357527742&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
